@node Overview
@chapter Overview
@cindex overview
@cindex inventory service

The @strong{inventory service} keeps stock levels for every @emph{warehouse}
and answers reorder questions. See @ref{Endpoints} and @xref{Configuration}.
Also @pxref{Markup}, or @inforef{Top, , inventory}, or
@uref{https://example.com/docs, the documentation}.

